      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "そっか……。\r\nだったら俺たちが調べてもいいぜ。\r\nダリオのことは気になっていたしな。",
        "official_en": "Gotcha. Well, we could look into it for you. I was kinda curious about what happened to him myself.",
        "real_en": null
      },
