      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "それでしたら「ダリオの似顔絵」があるので、\r\n持っていってください。",
        "official_en": "In that case... Here, take this portrait of Dario. You’ll have an easier time asking.",
        "real_en": "I have a portrait of Dario, so please take it with you."
