        "official_en_sha256": "08f68d12419e3c8cb708a00b32037413dd93444901effffe3784916c8c388936"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "何も言わずにいなくなったせいで、\r\nみんなはスパイだったんじゃないかと言っています。",
        "official_en": "You know what the other guys are saying? That he was a spy for the regime!",
        "real_en": "Because he vanished without saying anything, everyone thinks he might have been a spy."
      },
      "review": {
