      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "俺が最後にダリオを見たのは、\r\nゾルダードの街中です。",
        "official_en": "The last place I saw Dario was in Zoldaad.",
        "real_en": "The last time I saw Dario was in the city of Zoldaad."
      },
