      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "俺はあいつのことを相棒だと思っていたから、\r\nすごく悔しくて……。",
        "official_en": "I always thought of him as a brother, so it’s really been rubbing me the wrong way.",
        "real_en": "I thought of him as my partner, so it's been really frustrating..."
